{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project DE is a multiplayer action game that combines an extraction action RPG with high-quality pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a city transformed into a dungeon, you must command a team of &quot;divers&quot; Who are searching for loot in another world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, fight, and escape this place teeming with Mysterious  and madness\u2014all to complete the mission and return alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/7ccc5493aa8b612787b747b5c61ca704.poster.avif?t=1764324072\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/7ccc5493aa8b612787b747b5c61ca704.webm?t=1764324072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/7ccc5493aa8b612787b747b5c61ca704.mp4?t=1764324072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dungeons with up to two players. You can also adventure solo.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a variety of characters with distinct combat styles and skills.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience thrilling action-packed battles amidst the ruins of a city.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/7236aa4605f1b6478069efeef6b05870.poster.avif?t=1764324072\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/7236aa4605f1b6478069efeef6b05870.webm?t=1764324072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/7236aa4605f1b6478069efeef6b05870.mp4?t=1764324072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/c5d7501e9736d0a2aff61885fde2c50e.poster.avif?t=1764324072\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/c5d7501e9736d0a2aff61885fde2c50e.webm?t=1764324072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/c5d7501e9736d0a2aff61885fde2c50e.mp4?t=1764324072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the bizarre spatial structures of a city fused with another world.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover the valuables requested and escape safely.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various artifacts containing supernatural items, forbidden magic, and the power of the paranormal await.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/425f74941bd1fda59bf7e6094b05bd02.poster.avif?t=1764324072\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/425f74941bd1fda59bf7e6094b05bd02.webm?t=1764324072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/425f74941bd1fda59bf7e6094b05bd02.mp4?t=1764324072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight off isekai monsters, insane humans, and runaway machines.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various terrains and tools to increase your chances of survival.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeon inflicts a terrible curse on the diver: the Paradox. Find a cure to overcome it.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purify your madness, or embrace it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Growth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/af9a7b845e0d32a73aeb974789b42487.poster.avif?t=1764324072\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/af9a7b845e0d32a73aeb974789b42487.webm?t=1764324072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/af9a7b845e0d32a73aeb974789b42487.mp4?t=1764324072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop a variety of characters with unique skills.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your unique build with a variety of weapons and accessories.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine exclusive skill trees and traits to maximize your playstyle.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run a store</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/af97f77de053f026edde09e9fbd0895a.poster.avif?t=1764324072\" width=768 height=432 ><sou